# Copy to caddy/.env and fill in. .env is gitignored -- never commit the token.
#
# DNSimple API token with ZONE WRITE access for thejustinwalsh.me.
# Create at: https://dnsimple.com/a/<account>/account/access_tokens
# An ACCOUNT token is required (a user token will not work for zone records).
#
# Caddy uses this for the ACME DNS-01 challenge: it writes a temporary
# _acme-challenge TXT record to prove control of the domain. This is the only
# challenge type that works here, because the hostname resolves to a private
# ZeroTier address that Let's Encrypt cannot reach over HTTP.
DNSIMPLE_API_TOKEN=
